<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Dashboard Premium Simulados SAS ENEM | Ari de Sá</title>
<style>
:root {
  --azul-900:#061B3A;
  --azul-800:#082A5E;
  --azul-700:#0B3D91;
  --azul-600:#1456B8;
  --azul-100:#EAF2FF;
  --cinza-50:#F7FAFC;
  --cinza-100:#EEF3F8;
  --cinza-200:#D9E3EF;
  --cinza-500:#64748B;
  --cinza-700:#334155;
  --verde:#17A34A;
  --amarelo:#F59E0B;
  --vermelho:#DC2626;
  --branco:#FFFFFF;
  --sombra: 0 16px 35px rgba(6, 27, 58, .10);
  --borda: 1px solid rgba(8, 42, 94, .12);
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body {
  margin:0;
  font-family: Inter, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
  background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(20,86,184,.14), transparent 30%), linear-gradient(135deg, #F7FAFC 0%, #EAF2FF 100%);
  color:var(--cinza-700);
}
.hero {
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(255,255,255,.22), transparent 35%),
    linear-gradient(120deg, var(--azul-900), var(--azul-700));
  color:white;
  padding:28px 30px 26px;
  position:sticky;
  top:0;
  z-index:20;
  box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(6, 27, 58, .24);
}
.hero-inner{display:flex;gap:18px;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;max-width:1500px;margin:auto}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px}
.logo-card{
  width:218px;min-width:218px;height:76px;border-radius:20px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.98);
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:10px 14px;
  box-shadow:0 16px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.22);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.58);
}
.logo-card img{width:190px;height:auto;display:block;object-fit:contain}
.internal-strip{background:rgba(255,255,255,.92);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(8,42,94,.10);box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(6,27,58,.08)}
.internal-strip-inner{max-width:1500px;margin:auto;padding:10px 30px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;color:var(--azul-800);font-size:12px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em}.status-dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#17A34A;display:inline-block;margin-right:7px;box-shadow:0 0 0 5px rgba(23,163,74,.12)}.system-tag{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;background:#EAF2FF;border:1px solid rgba(20,86,184,.18);border-radius:999px;padding:6px 10px;color:#082A5E}.hero-actions{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;align-items:flex-end}.hero-actions .badge{justify-content:center}.hero-meta{font-size:12px;color:#D6E7FF;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.04em}
.brand-title{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px}
.brand-kicker{font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;font-weight:900;color:#D6E7FF}
h1{font-size:29px;margin:0;letter-spacing:-.65px;line-height:1.05}
.subtitle{font-size:13px;opacity:.90;max-width:760px}
.badge{background:rgba(255,255,255,.14);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.24);padding:10px 14px;border-radius:999px;font-size:13px;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.18)}
.hero:after{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:-1px;height:5px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#FFFFFF,#7DB7FF,#FFFFFF);opacity:.9}
.main{max-width:1500px;margin:auto;padding:22px 22px 42px}
.panel{
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.92);border:var(--borda);border-radius:28px;
  padding:18px;box-shadow:var(--sombra);backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
}
.filters{display:grid;grid-template-columns: repeat(9, minmax(145px, 1fr));gap:12px;align-items:end}
label{font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:var(--azul-800);display:block;margin:0 0 6px}
select,input{
  width:100%;border:1px solid var(--cinza-200);border-radius:14px;padding:11px 12px;
  background:white;color:var(--cinza-700);outline:none;font-size:13px;
}
.actions{display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:flex-end;margin-top:12px}
button{border:0;border-radius:14px;padding:11px 14px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer}
.btn-primary{background:var(--azul-700);color:white}
.btn-light{background:var(--azul-100);color:var(--azul-800)}
.kpis{display:grid;grid-template-columns: repeat(7, minmax(120px, 1fr));gap:14px;margin-top:18px}
.kpi{
  background:white;border:var(--borda);border-radius:22px;padding:18px;
  box-shadow:0 10px 22px rgba(6,27,58,.06);position:relative;overflow:hidden
}
.kpi:before{content:"";position:absolute;right:-30px;top:-30px;width:86px;height:86px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--azul-100)}
.kpi .label{font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--cinza-500);font-weight:900;position:relative}
.kpi .value{font-size:28px;font-weight:900;color:var(--azul-900);margin-top:7px;position:relative}
.kpi .hint{font-size:12px;color:var(--cinza-500);margin-top:4px;position:relative}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.25fr .75fr;gap:18px;margin-top:18px}
.grid-2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px;margin-top:18px}
.card{
  background:white;border:var(--borda);border-radius:28px;padding:18px;box-shadow:var(--sombra);
}
.card h2{margin:0 0 6px;color:var(--azul-900);font-size:18px}
.card p{margin:0 0 14px;color:var(--cinza-500);font-size:12px}
.chart{width:100%;height:330px}
.chart-sm{height:270px}
.table-wrap{overflow:auto;max-height:560px;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid var(--cinza-200)}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;background:white;font-size:12px;min-width:980px}
th{position:sticky;top:0;background:var(--azul-800);color:white;text-align:left;padding:12px;white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer}
td{padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--cinza-100);white-space:nowrap}
tr:hover td{background:#F8FBFF}
.rank{font-weight:900;color:var(--azul-800)}
.area-score{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;line-height:1.15}.area-score b{font-size:13px;color:var(--azul-900)}.area-score small{font-size:10px;color:var(--cinza-500);font-weight:800}.ranking-wrap{overflow:auto;max-height:620px;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid rgba(79,195,255,.18)}.ranking-wrap table{min-width:980px}.ranking-wrap th{font-size:11px}.ranking-wrap td{font-size:11px}
.pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;border-radius:999px;padding:4px 8px;font-size:11px;font-weight:900}
.good{background:#DCFCE7;color:#166534}
.mid{background:#FEF3C7;color:#92400E}
.bad{background:#FEE2E2;color:#991B1B}
.note{font-size:12px;color:var(--cinza-500);margin-top:10px}
.footer{text-align:center;color:var(--cinza-500);font-size:12px;margin-top:22px}
@media(max-width:1100px){
  .logo-card{width:190px;min-width:190px;height:68px}.logo-card img{width:166px}
  .filters{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
  .kpis{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
  .grid,.grid-2{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .hero-inner{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}
}

.student-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1.9fr;gap:18px;align-items:start}
.student-summary{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#061B3A,#0B3D91);color:white;border-radius:22px;padding:18px;box-shadow:var(--sombra)}
.student-summary h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:18px}.student-summary .big{font-size:24px;font-weight:900;margin:10px 0}.mini-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:10px;margin-top:12px}.mini-card{background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);border-radius:16px;padding:10px}.mini-card b{display:block;font-size:18px}.subfilters{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(140px,1fr));gap:12px;margin:10px 0 14px}.question-table-wrap{overflow:auto;max-height:440px;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid var(--cinza-200)}.badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;border-radius:999px;padding:4px 9px;font-size:11px;font-weight:900}.badge-blue{background:#EAF2FF;color:#0B3D91}.badge-red{background:#FEE2E2;color:#B91C1C}.badge-yellow{background:#FEF3C7;color:#92400E}.badge-green{background:#DCFCE7;color:#166534}@media(max-width:980px){.student-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.subfilters{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}

/* ===== Atualização visual: sistema interno + neon ===== */
:root{--neon:#4FC3FF;--neon2:#0EA5E9;--glow:0 0 0 1px rgba(79,195,255,.22),0 0 22px rgba(79,195,255,.20),0 20px 45px rgba(6,27,58,.12)}
.hero{background:radial-gradient(circle at 12% 10%, rgba(79,195,255,.42), transparent 26%),radial-gradient(circle at 86% 18%, rgba(14,165,233,.22), transparent 28%),linear-gradient(120deg,#031229 0%,#062b63 48%,#064eb0 100%)!important;box-shadow:0 12px 35px rgba(6,27,58,.36),0 0 35px rgba(79,195,255,.18)!important;}
.logo-card{width:270px!important;min-width:270px!important;height:104px!important;border-radius:24px!important;background:rgba(255,255,255,.98)!important;padding:8px 12px!important;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.75),0 0 24px rgba(79,195,255,.34),0 18px 45px rgba(0,0,0,.25)!important;}
.logo-card img{width:245px!important;max-height:88px!important;object-fit:contain!important;image-rendering:auto!important;}
.card,.kpi,.filter-card{border:1px solid rgba(79,195,255,.20)!important;box-shadow:var(--glow)!important;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,.98),rgba(248,252,255,.96))!important;}
.card h2,.student-summary h3{letter-spacing:-.03em;color:#061B3A;}
select,input{border:1px solid rgba(14,86,184,.22)!important;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(79,195,255,.06)!important;transition:.2s ease!important;}
select:focus,input:focus{outline:none!important;border-color:#4FC3FF!important;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(79,195,255,.22),0 0 18px rgba(79,195,255,.16)!important;}
.area-neon-filter{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin:14px 0 18px;padding:14px;border-radius:18px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(234,242,255,.90),rgba(255,255,255,.82));border:1px solid rgba(79,195,255,.22);box-shadow:inset 0 0 24px rgba(79,195,255,.08)}
.area-neon-filter .label{font-size:12px;font-weight:900;color:#082A5E;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;align-self:center;margin-right:4px;}
.area-chip{border:1px solid rgba(79,195,255,.38);background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);color:#082A5E;border-radius:999px;padding:9px 14px;font-size:12px;font-weight:900;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(79,195,255,.10);transition:.18s ease;}
.area-chip:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(79,195,255,.28);}
.area-chip.active{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#082A5E,#0B69D1);color:#fff;border-color:#4FC3FF;box-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(79,195,255,.55),0 0 2px #fff inset;}
.question-table-wrap{border:1px solid rgba(79,195,255,.22)!important;box-shadow:0 0 28px rgba(79,195,255,.10)!important;}
#questionTable thead th{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:3;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#061B3A,#0B3D91)!important;color:white!important;box-shadow:0 2px 0 rgba(79,195,255,.38)!important;}
#questionTable tbody tr:hover{background:rgba(79,195,255,.09)!important;}
.badge-blue{box-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(79,195,255,.20)}
@media(max-width:980px){.logo-card{width:210px!important;min-width:210px!important;height:82px!important}.logo-card img{width:190px!important;max-height:68px!important}}



/* ===== Análise comparativa e destaques visuais ===== */
.comparison-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(180px,1fr));gap:14px;margin-top:10px}
.compare-card{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#061B3A,#0B3D91);color:white;border-radius:22px;padding:16px;border:1px solid rgba(79,195,255,.35);box-shadow:0 0 22px rgba(79,195,255,.20),0 18px 35px rgba(6,27,58,.14)}
.compare-card:after{content:"";position:absolute;right:-34px;top:-34px;width:110px;height:110px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(79,195,255,.20);filter:blur(.2px)}
.compare-card .label{font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;color:#D6E7FF;font-weight:900;position:relative;z-index:1}
.compare-card .value{font-size:28px;font-weight:950;margin-top:6px;position:relative;z-index:1}
.compare-card .hint{font-size:11px;color:#D6E7FF;margin-top:4px;position:relative;z-index:1}
.compare-table-wrap{overflow:auto;border:1px solid rgba(79,195,255,.22);border-radius:18px;margin-top:14px}
.compare-table-wrap table{min-width:980px}
.compare-bar{height:9px;background:#EAF2FF;border-radius:999px;overflow:hidden;min-width:120px;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(20,86,184,.08)}
.compare-bar span{display:block;height:100%;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#0B3D91,#4FC3FF);box-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(79,195,255,.65)}
.above-row td{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(220,252,231,.74),rgba(255,255,255,.88))}
.below-row td{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(254,242,242,.78),rgba(255,255,255,.92))}
.media-row td{position:sticky;bottom:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#061B3A,#0B3D91)!important;color:white!important;font-weight:950;border-top:2px solid #4FC3FF;box-shadow:0 -4px 16px rgba(79,195,255,.18)}
.medal{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:999px;background:#EAF2FF;color:#061B3A;font-weight:950;border:1px solid rgba(79,195,255,.32);box-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(79,195,255,.22)}
.medal.gold{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FFF7CC,#F59E0B)}.medal.silver{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#F8FAFC,#94A3B8)}.medal.bronze{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FFEDD5,#C2410C);color:white}
.legend-destaques{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px;font-size:11px;font-weight:900;color:#334155}.legend-destaques span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}.legend-dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block}.dot-green{background:#22C55E}.dot-red{background:#EF4444}.dot-blue{background:#4FC3FF}
@media(max-width:980px){.comparison-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}



/* ===== Versão final premium: filtros por simulado, ranking e ordenação ===== */
.filters-premium-note{margin-top:10px;font-size:11px;color:#64748B;font-weight:800}
.top-filter-bar{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(140px,1fr));gap:10px;margin:12px 0 14px;padding:12px;border-radius:18px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(234,242,255,.92),rgba(255,255,255,.88));border:1px solid rgba(79,195,255,.24);box-shadow:inset 0 0 22px rgba(79,195,255,.08)}
.premium-tag{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;border-radius:999px;padding:6px 10px;background:rgba(79,195,255,.12);border:1px solid rgba(79,195,255,.28);color:#082A5E;font-size:11px;font-weight:950;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase}
.card:hover,.kpi:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);transition:.2s ease}
.compare-bar span{animation:growBar .9s ease both}@keyframes growBar{from{width:0}}
@media(max-width:980px){.top-filter-bar{grid-template-columns:1fr}}

</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo-card"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Logomarca Ari de Sá" /></div>
      <div class="brand-title">
        <div class="brand-kicker">Colégio Ari de Sá Cavalcante</div>
        <h1>Dashboard Premium Simulados SAS ENEM</h1>
        <div class="subtitle">Painel interno de gestão acadêmica com análise integrada por sede, turma, modalidade, aluno, área do conhecimento, questões e desempenho.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-actions"><div class="badge">Painel interno • Arquivo único HTML</div><div class="hero-meta">Coordenação Pedagógica | 1º Simulado SAS ENEM</div></div>
  </div>
</header>
<div class="internal-strip">
  <div class="internal-strip-inner">
    <div><span class="status-dot"></span>Sistema interno de acompanhamento acadêmico</div>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:flex-end">
      <span class="system-tag">AD</span><span class="system-tag">DC</span><span class="system-tag">WS</span><span class="system-tag">3ª Série</span><span class="system-tag">Extensivo</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<main class="main">
  <section class="panel">
    <div class="filters">
      <div><label>Simulado SAS</label><select id="fSimulado"></select></div>
      <div><label>Sede</label><select id="fSede"></select></div>
      <div><label>Turma macro</label><select id="fTurmaMacro"></select></div>
      <div><label>Turma detalhada</label><select id="fTurma"></select></div>
      <div><label>Modalidade</label><select id="fModalidade"></select></div>
      <div><label>Faixa de desempenho</label><select id="fFaixa"></select></div>
      <div><label>Acertos totais</label><select id="fAcertos"></select></div>
      <div><label>Área dos acertos</label><select id="fAreaAcertos"></select></div>
      <div><label>Acertos na área</label><select id="fAcertosArea"></select></div>
      <div><label>Aluno</label><input id="fAluno" list="alunosList" placeholder="Digite o nome..." /><datalist id="alunosList"></datalist></div>
    </div>
    <div class="actions">
      <span class="premium-tag">Preparado para 6 simulados</span>
      <button class="btn-light" onclick="resetFilters()">Limpar filtros</button>
      <button class="btn-primary" onclick="exportCSV()">Exportar dados filtrados</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="kpis">
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">Alunos</div><div class="value" id="kTotal">-</div><div class="hint">registros filtrados</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">Média TRI</div><div class="value" id="kMedia">-</div><div class="hint">nota geral</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">Maior nota</div><div class="value" id="kMax">-</div><div class="hint">melhor desempenho</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">Menor nota</div><div class="value" id="kMin">-</div><div class="hint">menor desempenho</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">Acertos médios</div><div class="value" id="kAcertos">-</div><div class="hint">total de acertos</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">Acerto médio</div><div class="value" id="kPerc">-</div><div class="hint">estimado sobre 180 questões</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">Alunos em risco</div><div class="value" id="kRisco">-</div><div class="hint">nota abaixo de 600</div></div>
  </section>

  <section class="grid">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Comparativo por turma</h2>
      <p>Média TRI por turma macro, atualizada pelos filtros.</p>
      <div id="chartTurmas" class="chart"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Média por área</h2>
      <p>Linguagens, Humanas, Natureza e Matemática.</p>
      <div id="chartAreas" class="chart"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="grid-2">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Distribuição das notas</h2>
      <p>Quantidade de alunos por faixa de nota.</p>
      <div id="chartHist" class="chart-sm"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Comparativo por sede</h2>
      <p>Média TRI por AD, DC e WS.</p>
      <div id="chartSedes" class="chart-sm"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="grid-2">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Top 80 alunos</h2>
      <p>Ranking dos maiores desempenhos dentro do recorte filtrado, com nota TRI e acertos por área. Use os filtros abaixo para recortar somente este ranking por sede e modalidade.</p>
      <div class="top-filter-bar">
        <div><label>Sede no Top 80</label><select id="fTopSede"></select></div>
        <div><label>Modalidade no Top 80</label><select id="fTopModalidade"></select></div>
        <div><label>Ordenação</label><select id="fTopOrdenacao"><option value="nota">Média TRI</option><option value="acertos">Acertos totais</option><option value="mat">Matemática</option><option value="ling">Linguagens</option><option value="hum">Humanas</option><option value="nat">Natureza</option></select></div>
      </div>
      <div id="topList"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Alunos em atenção</h2>
      <p>Menores notas dentro do recorte filtrado para intervenção pedagógica.</p>
      <div id="riskList"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="card" style="margin-top:18px">
    <h2>Análise comparativa e destaques visuais</h2>
    <p>Comparação entre média geral da base, recorte filtrado, Top 80 e alunos em atenção. As barras e destaques são recalculados automaticamente pelos filtros.</p>
    <div id="comparePanel"></div>
  </section>


  <section class="card" style="margin-top:18px">
    <h2>Análise individual por aluno, prova e conteúdo</h2>
    <p>Selecione um aluno no filtro superior e escolha o tipo/cor da prova. O painel cruza o desempenho do aluno com o modelo de análise da prova.</p>
    <div class="subfilters">
      <div><label>Tipo/cor da prova</label><select id="fTipoProva"></select></div>
      <div><label>Prova / dia</label><select id="fProvaDia"></select></div>
      <div><label>Área da questão</label><select id="fAreaQuestao"></select></div>
